{'symbol': 'CVX', 'date': '2022-11-07 20:00:00', 'title': 'CHEVRON AND JERA ADVANCE LOWER CARBON SOLUTIONS IN ASIA PACIFIC AND THE U.S.', 'text': 'HOUSTON & TOKYO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CHEVRON CORPORATION (NYSE: CVX), THROUGH ITS CHEVRON NEW ENERGIES BUSINESS, AND JERA ARE COLLABORATING ON MULTIPLE LOWER CARBON OPPORTUNITIES – INCLUDING PRODUCTION; CARBON CAPTURE, UTILIZATION, AND STORAGE; AND NEW TECHNOLOGY COMMERCIALIZATION – FOCUSED ON THE U.S. AND ASIA PACIFIC REGION.'}